<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container my-4">
    <h2 class="section-title">Contest Rules</h2>
    <p class="text-muted mb-4">Official rules for JamesThew cooking competitions.</p>

    <div class="card p-4">
        <h4>1. Eligibility</h4>
        <p>Premium and VIP members may submit contest entries. Free members can browse contests and vote on submissions.</p>

        <h4>2. Scoring (Dual-Rating)</h4>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Like Rate:</strong> Community likes on your submission.</li>
            <li><strong>Star Rate:</strong> Combined score from engagement (likes, comments) and judge ratings (1–5 scale).</li>
        </ul>

        <h4>3. Daily Limits</h4>
        <p>FAQ questions and comments are limited per day by membership tier (Free / Premium / VIP) to prevent spam.</p>

        <h4>4. Submissions</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>One original recipe per contest unless stated otherwise.</li>
            <li>Include a photo and clear instructions.</li>
            <li>Plagiarized or offensive content will be removed.</li>
        </ul>

        <h4>5. Winners</h4>
        <p>Winners are announced on the <a href="/contests/winners">Winners page</a> after each contest closes. Prizes vary by event.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-4">
        <a href="/contests" class="btn btn-outline">Back to Contests</a>
        <a href="/contests/faq" class="btn btn-primary ms-2">View FAQ</a>
    </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
